00:32:41.000 --> 00:32:55.000
Right. So this is like Berkeley. This is like a student sit-in in California. Right, exactly. Or the London School of Economics or the sit-ins that have been so familiar in the 60s and 70s. Secondly, an obvious point, the Marines are massively outnumbered. I think there are about just over a dozen Marines in the compound.

