in the foreign ministry forever forever. Well what happens to them? Do they get out as well in the end? Well they're hostages they're hostages but stuck in the foreign ministry not even with their maids back in the embassy well as we will see the hostages end up a lot of them end up getting spit up against solitary confinement and so on and so forth

