bad tempered. They spend a lot of time screaming at each other and at the hostages. Some of the hostages, the women and African Americans, were released before the end of November after a few weeks, obviously because the captors wanted to make a political point. This is the sort of 1968 side of the Iranian revolution. So that left 52 of them still in captivity.

