and he makes it into a duel between himself and Jimmy Carter. So Khomeini gave interviews to all three American networks pretty much straight after the seizure of the US embassy. He was completely unflappable. He was completely unrepentant. He said the hostages were spies. This is all Carter's fault. It's Carter, who's the criminal breaking international law

