122
00:50:45.000 --> 00:51:14.000
But I think the Ayatollah is kind of making the figure of Satan into a kind of, you know, a Manichaean figure of evil. And that's what America becomes for him. And of course, in America as well, you also have this Manichian sense of good and evil. And both sides now are starting to think of the other as a literal cosmic representation. of evil.

