peace activist called William Sloan Coffin. And he, so you've got diplolyn. Matt's called sick. You've got clergyman called coffin. But wait for it. This is unbelievable. This bloke turned up and he met the hostages and he said to them, you know, they were hoping for an inspiring message from an American priest and he said, stop feeling sorry for

