00:54:22.000 --> 00:54:49.000
yourselves. He said, I envy you having an extended period of peace and quiet to rest and think. And their hostages listen to this in stupefaction. And then when the meeting was over, he went to front of the cameras and he said on American TV, yeah, we scream and shout about the hostages. but very few Americans heard the screams of tortured Iranians. And this kind of thing, obviously, the hostages don't want to hear this. And then actually, it possibly even worse than this.

131
00:54:49.000 --> 00:55:15.000
